# What of math-app/ goes public, and what does not.
#
# Published as VeeranuchLee/magic-math, served at veeranuchlee.github.io/magic-math/.
# The hub has shown one Magic Math card since 2026-09-09; its front door, index.html
# here, lists Space Math and Unicorn Math. Magic Spelling is reached from Our Word
# Book's Spelling card (word-book/index.html), which still points straight at
# magic-math/magic-spelling.html; the move into word-book is specified, not done.
# Classical Music left the front page on 2026-09-15 and sits on the hub's Music page
# (site/children-apps/music.html), which points straight at
# magic-math/classical-music.html. All four pages still ship from this directory.
# `scripts/ship-list.py` reads this file; `scripts/preflight.sh` runs it on
# every commit. Nothing publishes unless named here, and a wildcard never carries
# Markdown.
#
# THIS DIRECTORY LEAKED. On 2026-08-19 11:02 ICT `work_progress_and_other_discussion.md`
# and `README.md` — the discussion trail and the 29 KB internal design document — were
# copied to the public repo and served for about 23 hours before being removed on
# 2026-08-20. That is what this file exists to make impossible.
#
# The publish is not a plain copy. `node tools/build-for-publish.js <copy>` runs on
# the copy afterwards: it compiles the JSX, strips the Babel script tag, deletes
# `vendor/babel-7.26.4.min.js` and drops it from the service worker's shell. So Babel
# is shipped here and removed there — the public repo correctly has no copy of it.
# `archive/v1..v7.html` sit in the public repo as history and have no source here.

